OL,8,FTarrawingee, was detained at the scene
OL,9,Fby a passer-by before being taken into
OL,10,Fcustody
OL,12,FPolice say it was an 'isolated
OL,13,Fincident' and they are working to
OL,14,Fidentify potential charges
