OL,3,ADelayed start keeps polls open late in
OL,4,AAlberta referendum on separation from
OL,5,ACanada
OL,6,
OL,7,FSeparatists argue the province - which
OL,8,Fhas the fourth largest oil reserves in
OL,9,Fthe world - has been overlooked by
OL,10,FOttawa
OL,12,FMeanwhile, indigenous Albertans have
OL,13,Fbeen working to block the vote for
OL,14,Fmonths, arguing separation would
OL,15,Fviolate their land treaties
OL,17,FWhat happens next? If a majority vote
OL,18,Ffor independence, it would kick-start
OL,19,Fthe process of holding a binding
OL,20,Freferendum on separation
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
